<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">weapon-combat</ansi> skill

The <ansi fg="skill">weapon-combat</ansi> skill governs your proficiency
with all melee weapons — swords, axes, maces, daggers, and more.
Higher ranks improve your hit chance, damage output, and ability
to dual-wield effectively.

Weapon-combat improves through use. Every successful melee attack
with a weapon has a chance to advance this skill.

This skill also affects your parry defense when wielding a weapon.

